TI  - Developing a static microsimulation model for the analysis of housing taxation in Italy
AU  - Pellegrino, Simone
AU  - Piacenza, Massimiliano
AU  - Turati, Gilberto
VL  - 4
IS  - 2
PY  - 2011
DA  - 2011/08/31
